I thought question 8 tested the limits of the orchestrators routing and synthesis because it was unanswerable. The question "What is the office cafeteria menu for next week?" required information that was not available in any of the documents. There was no failure mode for this question since it just returned that it was unable to answer the question. It shows that the system is fragile because there are more opportunities for a hallucination when there are multiple agents the query can go to, which may not have all the same guardrails.